{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 16060696654163237420,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Check if two segments intersect",
      "source_hash": 14436038685117764545,
      "context_hash": 13983944441198152827,
      "translation": "두 선분이 교차하는지 확인하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "You are given two segments $(a, b)$ and $(c, d)$.",
      "source_hash": 17581617684673295823,
      "context_hash": 6559129482006845801,
      "translation": "$(a, b)$와 $(c, d)$라는 두 선분이 주어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "You have to check if they intersect.",
      "source_hash": 15242950503186278992,
      "context_hash": 10663125428880443532,
      "translation": "이 두 선분이 교차하는지 확인해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Of course, you may find their intersection and check if it isn't empty, but this can't be done in integers for segments with integer coordinates.",
      "source_hash": 6890648625357854177,
      "context_hash": 9019610757149940333,
      "translation": "물론 두 선분의 교점을 구한 뒤 그것이 비어 있지 않은지 확인할 수도 있지만, 정수 좌표를 갖는 선분에 대해서는 이 방법을 정수 연산만으로 수행할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "The approach described here can work in integers.",
      "source_hash": 16515670053875074839,
      "context_hash": 2666700484776585924,
      "translation": "여기서 설명하는 접근 방식은 정수 연산으로 동작할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Algorithm",
      "source_hash": 1302133540553668709,
      "context_hash": 16087510094776590843,
      "translation": "알고리즘",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Firstly, consider the case when the segments are part of the same line.",
      "source_hash": 2820544540061985616,
      "context_hash": 10479120173865701350,
      "translation": "먼저 두 선분이 같은 직선 위에 있는 경우를 생각해 봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "In this case it is sufficient to check if their projections on $Ox$ and $Oy$ intersect.",
      "source_hash": 7996285242491833649,
      "context_hash": 1083608724609780481,
      "translation": "이 경우에는 $Ox$와 $Oy$ 위로의 사영이 교차하는지 확인하는 것으로 충분합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "In the other case $a$ and $b$ must not lie on the same side of line $(c, d)$, and $c$ and $d$ must not lie on the same side of line $(a, b)$.",
      "source_hash": 6723459829330482634,
      "context_hash": 16398860691748727722,
      "translation": "그렇지 않은 경우에는 $a$와 $b$가 직선 $(c, d)$의 같은 쪽에 있으면 안 되고, $c$와 $d$도 직선 $(a, b)$의 같은 쪽에 있으면 안 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "It can be checked with a couple of cross products.",
      "source_hash": 804626222317449526,
      "context_hash": 16954314154866934250,
      "translation": "이는 외적을 몇 번 계산해 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 9697513182209129786,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The given algorithm is implemented for integer points.",
      "source_hash": 10267969551141296083,
      "context_hash": 9240259161814597414,
      "translation": "주어진 알고리즘은 정수 좌표를 갖는 점들에 대해 구현되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Of course, it can be easily modified to work with doubles.",
      "source_hash": 10141188347202035834,
      "context_hash": 11883405442937775818,
      "translation": "물론 실수(double)를 다루도록 쉽게 수정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:31:41.136363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Practice Problems",
      "source_hash": 14625287703467845191,
      "context_hash": 2968715901351235014,
      "translation": "연습 문제",
